The crash says "Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'states')" and points me to Visustella's Skills/States core for the error.
I don't know if I'm doing something wrong in my alias or what, I followed a guide online on how to do it and have checked everything thrice, but it's just not playing nice with Visustella. Tried changing the plugin order too.
